WEBVTT

00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:31.413
I never I mean, I do unpaid
public talks, too.

00:01:31.413 --> 00:01:35.288
But what I mean is I never in my wildest
dreams imagined that I would be,

00:01:35.704 --> 00:01:37.663
you know, traveling the world,
giving talks.

00:01:37.746 --> 00:01:39.704
And I and I am like I actually have

00:01:39.704 --> 00:01:42.913
a whole career of that in
addition to my writing.

00:01:42.913 --> 00:01:46.579
And that was born out of a combination of,
you know, wild success.

00:01:46.579 --> 00:01:52.329
And then also my you know, much to my
surprise, I'm good at it and I enjoy it.

00:01:53.121 --> 00:01:56.204
I understand that you're a
huge planner, as am I.

00:01:56.246 --> 00:02:00.038
And it's been hard for you not to know
what you're doing next month or July